          <item row="3" column="0">
           <widget class="QLabel" name="labelGuide">
            <property name="text">
             <string>
&lt;html&gt;
&lt;body&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
&lt;b&gt;Mini guida Argos Translate&lt;/b&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
1. Installa Argos:
&lt;br&gt;
&lt;code&gt;python -m pip install argostranslate&lt;/code&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
2. Inserisci le lingue, ad esempio &lt;b&gt;it, en&lt;/b&gt;,
e premi &lt;b&gt;Install language models&lt;/b&gt;.
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
Il download dei modelli richiede Internet,
ma la traduzione successiva viene eseguita localmente.
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;
Documentazione:
&lt;a href=&quot;https://argos-translate.readthedocs.io/&quot;&gt;
Argos Translate
&lt;/a&gt;
&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;/body&gt;
&lt;/html&gt;
         </string>
